{
 "section": "PROTECTED_MODEL.md 18.4.7",
 "note": "Test keys only, made by protected40.py from fixed labels (stream(label, n): SHA-256 of the label and a 32-bit little-endian counter, concatenated). No SDK trusts them.",
 "rule": "anchor of a lease = iat on a first lease, else max(floor now, iat); refused as expired when anchor >= exp; a lease sets floor = now = anchor, offset = anchor - wall. floor now = floor + (boot - last_boot) on the same boot, floor + boot on another. now = last_now + (boot - last_boot) on the same boot (the wall clock is not read); on another boot max(last_now + boot, wall + offset); never below the floor. floor, now, boot and boot_id are stored at each use; valid while now < exp",
